      "statement": "package.json defines four npm scripts — dev (next dev), build (next build), start (next start), and lint (eslint --fix) — and contains no test script; the lint script runs the installed ESLint v10 binary directly with the --fix flag because next lint no longer exists in this Next.js version, so linting mutates files in place rather than only reporting issues.",
