    {
      "id": "claim_623e3161fb0d4308a51a26f91c611e79",
      "statement": "The repository has no unit or integration test harness: package.json has no test script, no test-runner configuration or test files exist anywhere, and CI runs no test step; test/test-sadsam-json.json is a manual fixture rather than automated test input and is excluded from Docker images by .dockerignore. The validation practice is npm run build plus npx eslint . — which together mirror the verify.yml CI gate — or npm run lint (which fixes in place) when UI code changes.",
