      "id": "claim_cb87b9e0340941ca91698ae7d7b9be5b",
      "statement": "The active ESLint configuration is the flat config in eslint.config.mjs: it spreads eslint-config-next/core-web-vitals and eslint-config-next/typescript and globally ignores .next/**, out/**, build/**, and next-env.d.ts without any rule overrides, so the Next.js core-web-vitals and TypeScript defaults apply unchanged. The legacy .eslintrc.json at the repository root still declares two rule overrides (no-console at error level allowing console.warn and console.error, and @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any at warn), but the ESLint v10 binary that the lint script (package.json line 9) and CI invoke resolves flat config instead, so those legacy overrides have no effect and lint behavior must be changed in eslint.config.mjs.",
