    {
      "id": "claim_d31af3bdfd8149d59b8891e3a34809cb",
      "statement": "test/test-sadsam-json.json is a complete sample SAD_SAM get-result payload — top-level requestId, status \"OK\", message, traceLinkType \"SAD_SAM\", and a traceLinks array whose entries carry sentenceNumber (0-based on the wire; parseTraceLinksFromJSON adds 1 for display), modelElementUid, and confidence. Its entry field names (modelElementUid) differ from the parser's RawTraceLink interface fields (modelElementId/modelElementName/codeElementId/codeElementName), so it is a hand-written illustrative fixture, not captured API output; no source code references it, so it serves as a manual fixture for the trace-link parsing path (for example via the /load-project stored-project flow), not as automated test input.",
