    {
      "id": "claim_c9d961880a6f4c1085cc6c23bfbafa1c",
      "statement": "TraceView requires a reachable ARDoCo REST backend at runtime: the backend address is browser state owned by ApiAddressContext, defaulting to https://rest.ardoco.de and hydrated from the localStorage key apiAddress (null on the server during hydration), editable through the navbar's ApiAddressDisplay/EditApiAddressModal; a candidate address is probed with GET /api/health through the proxy middleware and is persisted to localStorage (and activated) only when the probe succeeds, so a failed probe leaves the previously active address unchanged.",
      "evidence": [
